# Production build settings. Vite reads this on `npm run build` on top of .env.
#
# Only the API address differs between local and hosted. The Firebase web config in
# .env is public by design and identical everywhere, so it is not repeated here.
#
# The backend runs on your Oracle Always Free instance, behind Caddy for HTTPS. Firebase
# Hosting is HTTPS, so a plain-http API here would be blocked as mixed content — the
# scheme must be https and the host must have a certificate.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.YOUR-DOMAIN.example
